# Keep the keeper image lean and never ship secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/target
frontend
tests
docs
.git
.superstack
secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.log
*.so
# Bot wallet secret keys (see keepers/src/shared/bot-wallets.ts,
# BOT_KEYS_DIR = keepers/.bot-keys) and the local fills indexer DB — both are
# generated on disk by keepers that have already run and are gitignored, but
# a plain `COPY keepers ./keepers` in the Dockerfile would otherwise bake
# whatever happens to exist on the build host straight into the image layer.
keepers/.bot-keys
keepers/data
